00:02:41.180 --> 00:02:44.290
<i>Today's my chance to show 
Hitomi-chan how great I am!</i>

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:46.140
<i>And after that, we'll go and...</i>

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:49.730
Eee! How wonderful!

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:51.850
Eee! How wonderful!

00:02:53.190 --> 00:02:56.080
I had no idea you were so amazing, Jin-kun!

00:02:56.080 --> 00:02:58.400
I love you!

00:02:58.000 --> 00:02:58.400
<i>This'll work!</i>

00:03:01.290 --> 00:03:03.610
You're scary today, Jin-kun...

00:03:03.610 --> 00:03:05.120
Everyone!

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:10.580
Once I'm finished transporting this,
 I'll come help you!

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:12.210
What's in that thing?

00:03:13.450 --> 00:03:14.420
Hello.

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:16.000
Oh, An-chan!

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:17.620
You really came!

00:03:17.620 --> 00:03:18.250
Yes.

00:03:18.250 --> 00:03:20.530
It's An! Yay!

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:21.470
Hey, hey!

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:24.650
Since you're here, you should 
help out at our restaurant, too!

00:03:24.650 --> 00:03:26.470
It'll be fun!

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:29.640
Um, I agree with her.

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:30.810
How about it, An-chan?

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:33.090
Only if you can, of course.

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:36.320
If it's okay with all of you.

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:38.260
Of course it's okay!

00:03:38.260 --> 00:03:38.990
Right?

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:40.570
Of course!

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:40.570
Momantai!

00:03:40.930 --> 00:03:42.280
You agree, right, Jin?

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:45.490
I'm very interested in you.

00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:47.030
Sure.

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:50.700
If that's what Anetani-san wants, I don't mind.

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:53.710
<i>I swear I'm going to make 
this bastard extinct!</i>

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:54.910
Heya!

00:03:54.910 --> 00:03:56.590
I'm here to help out, Hitomi!

00:03:56.590 --> 00:03:59.040
Yena-kun, you're here, too?

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:00.260
You better believe it!

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:02.550
I can't say no to you, Hitomi!

00:04:04.030 --> 00:04:06.380
Hey, who's the chick with the cold eyes?

00:04:06.380 --> 00:04:09.330
That's our human friend. Her name's An-chan.

00:04:09.330 --> 00:04:11.230
Human, huh? That's unusu—

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:14.690
Hitomi asked me to help, too.

00:04:14.690 --> 00:04:16.230
Uh, you're getting kinda close...

00:04:17.810 --> 00:04:20.110
O-Okay, you two can...

00:04:22.850 --> 00:04:25.550
You both look fantastic!

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:30.130
Everything's ready here, too.

00:04:30.130 --> 00:04:32.250
All right, then...

