Table 5!

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:51.560
For the stupid bull and the stupid horse!

00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:53.930
So good!

00:04:52.950 --> 00:04:54.560
Yum!

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:55.940
Jin-kun, another order!

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:57.120
Right!

00:04:57.120 --> 00:04:59.440
Table 3, for the stupid hippos!

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:01.940
Hippopotama!

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:05.700
Table 9, for the stupid lesser 
tube-nosed fruit bat!

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:06.510
Right.

00:05:06.510 --> 00:05:10.210
Whew... We're a lot busier than I expected.

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:13.290
And I still need to get that ready...

00:05:20.180 --> 00:05:21.800
Whew, I'm beat!

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:24.220
Seriously, this is such hard work.

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:25.500
Yo, stupid panda!

00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:28.400
Quit slacking, or I'll make <i>you</i> into 
dumplings and feed you to the animals!

00:05:28.400 --> 00:05:29.580
Aiya!

00:05:29.580 --> 00:05:30.220
Get moving!

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:30.720
Eek!

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:34.010
Here's your silver vine tea.

00:05:34.010 --> 00:05:35.050
Took ya long enough!

00:05:35.050 --> 00:05:37.980
How long's it take to brew one cup of tea?!

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:44.220
Yena-kun! No hitting the customers!

00:05:44.220 --> 00:05:45.760
Sorry! I'll kick them next time!

00:05:45.760 --> 00:05:46.900
You're missing the point!

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:49.600
How about their eyes, then? 
Should I gouge out their eyes?

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:51.380
No! I'm saying...

00:05:51.380 --> 00:05:52.830
Now isn't the time.

00:05:51.380 --> 00:05:53.460
How about their noses? Tails?

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:54.450
We'd like to order, please!

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:55.490
Coming.

