That sure was fast!

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:06.250
Thanks, An!

00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:07.130
From me, too!

00:06:08.010 --> 00:06:10.100
I knew my pack could do it!

00:06:10.100 --> 00:06:11.540
Hey, stupid dog! Cut it out!

00:06:11.540 --> 00:06:13.870
You're covering them in drool.

00:06:13.870 --> 00:06:16.070
Yena, you should join my pack now, too!

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:18.870
I won't join any pack.

00:06:18.870 --> 00:06:19.970
Yena-kun...

00:06:20.910 --> 00:06:22.510
Thanks for helping today.

00:06:22.510 --> 00:06:23.350
Sure!

00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:25.070
I'll help out tomorrow, too!

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:27.830
Hey! Get your paws off her!

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:27.830
<i>Not my Hitomi!</i>

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:30.690
Wait, that's not what I meant...

00:06:30.690 --> 00:06:32.030
All right, now...

00:06:32.350 --> 00:06:35.620
You guys, clean up and start 
getting ingredients for tomorrow.

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:36.690
Okay!

00:06:36.690 --> 00:06:37.930
Aw, already?

00:06:37.930 --> 00:06:39.800
What a drag!

00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:43.250
<i>Gotta get this over with so I can 
roam the festival with Hitomi-chan!</i>

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:47.130
I need to go get more vegetables 
from the gardening club.

00:06:47.470 --> 00:06:48.630
<i>Now's my chance!</i>

00:06:49.090 --> 00:06:50.300
I want to go, too.

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:52.110
Huh? Okay, sure.

00:06:52.110 --> 00:06:53.810
I guess I'll tag along, too.

00:06:53.810 --> 00:06:54.780
No need.

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:57.270
Hitomi and I will go alone.

00:06:57.270 --> 00:06:59.960
Huh? Why do you get to decide that?

00:06:59.960 --> 00:07:03.230
Just so you know, Hitomi and I are 
close enough to eat together!

00:07:03.670 --> 00:07:06.470
I shared a bath and a bed with her.

00:07:07.010 --> 00:07:09.130
An-chan? Yena-kun?

00:07:09.130 --> 00:07:10.740
What's gotten into you two?

00:07:10.740 --> 00:07:11.930
Hey!

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:15.330
We all worked hard together, 
so no fighting!

00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:18.690
An, that's an order from your boss!

00:07:18.690 --> 00:07:20.070
I'm sorry.

00:07:20.070 --> 00:07:21.600
Yena, you better stop, too!

00:07:21.600 --> 00:07:22.780
Uh, sure...

00:07:22.780 --> 00:07:24.730
Now, make up!

00:07:25.350 --> 00:07:26.630
<i>She's...</i>

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:31.700
O-Okay, Yena-kun, could you go to 
the cafeteria and make sure our

00:07:31.700 --> 00:07:33.330
non-vegetable ingredients are there?

00:07:33.330 --> 00:07:34.720
Sure, got it.

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:37.510
Really, you're all such a handful!

00:07:37.510 --> 00:07:39.790
Ranka-san is smirking.

00:07:39.790 --> 00:07:42.700
She's probably thinking to herself that 
she sounded like a boss just now.

00:07:42.700 --> 00:07:45.690
And the president of the 
gardening club is a boar.

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:48.190
He's actually...

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:51.200
<b>Seton Academy 
Culture Festival</b>

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:51.200
<b>Seton
 Academy</b>

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:55.870
<b>Yangyang 
Cetartiodactyla Lipotidae Lipotes vexillifer</b>

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:55.870
Holding a culture festival? 
How very carefree.

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:58.790
Truly something a school for 
modern species would do.

00:07:55.910 --> 00:07:58.790
<b>Babari Atlas 
Carnivora Felidae Panthera leo leo</b>

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:01.790
They're all having such a delightful time.

00:07:58.830 --> 00:08:01.790
<b>Washima Komandorski 
Sirenia Dugongidae Hydrodamalis gigas</b>

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:06.540
Just like the boss said, this is the 
perfect opportunity to go hunting.

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:06.540
<b>Ando Andrew 
Mesonychia Triisodontidae Andrewsarchus andrewsarchus</b>

00:08:07.110 --> 00:08:09.210
Barbarybarybarybary!

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:10.420
Let's move!

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:14.210
We are the Extinct Species Alliance: Team EX!

00:08:14.210 --> 00:08:15.890
Hi there!

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:18.710
Welcome to the Seton Academy Culture Festival!

00:08:18.710 --> 00:08:20.620
Where are you visiting from?

00:08:20.620 --> 00:08:23.100
This is our pamphlet!

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:24.820
Uh, thanks...

00:08:24.820 --> 00:08:26.340
Have a balloon, too!

00:08:26.340 --> 00:08:27.570
Th-Thanks...

00:08:27.570 --> 00:08:28.370
Oh...

00:08:28.370 --> 00:08:29.210
Okay.

00:08:29.210 --> 00:08:31.620
Have a great time!

00:08:33.140 --> 00:08:36.520
I can't stand modern species. 
They're so overly chipper.

00:08:36.520 --> 00:08:38.540
They were only able to interrupt us because

00:08:38.540 --> 00:08:40.120
you were too slow on the rallying cry, Babari!

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:42.870
What? That's big talk for a dolphin.

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:46.380
Excuse me? You're just a big, hairy caterpillar!

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:47.270
Cater—

00:08:47.270 --> 00:08:50.280
How dare you mock my mane?!

00:08:50.280 --> 00:08:51.760
Both of you, shut up!

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:55.760
If you start infighting, 
I'll bite you both in half!

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:58.340
If I may be so bold, Ando-san,

00:08:58.340 --> 00:09:01.060
you died out due to changes in 
the climate and Earth's crust,

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:03.160
so there's no need for you to be here.

00:09:03.160 --> 00:09:05.770
Hey! You're not supposed to talk about that!

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:08.780
Come on, now. We're all on the same side here.

00:09:08.780 --> 00:09:11.610
A fatty has no right to talk down to us, fatty!

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:15.030
I'm not fat! I just have a 
lot of subcutaneous fat!

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:26.300
An-chan, I'd like it if you could 
try to get along with Yena-kun.

00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:30.070
I know! Hang on just a sec...

00:09:31.060 --> 00:09:33.670
Here. I thought it might look nice on you.

00:09:34.420 --> 00:09:35.800
For me?

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:37.130
Yeah!

00:09:38.750 --> 00:09:41.460
Sorry... I guess I shouldn't have 
made that decision on my own.

00:09:41.460 --> 00:09:42.980
I don't understand.

00:09:42.980 --> 00:09:43.600
Huh?

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:46.830
Ever since you let me stay 
in your room that night,

00:09:46.830 --> 00:09:50.470
whenever I'm with you... 
whenever I'm with all of you...

00:09:51.060 --> 00:09:54.610
I can feel something 
expanding inside my chest.

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:57.970
What is this feeling?

00:09:58.510 --> 00:09:59.590
An-chan...

00:09:59.590 --> 00:10:02.240
I get it! I totally understand!

00:10:02.240 --> 00:10:05.030
I didn't have any friends 
for a long time, either.

00:10:05.030 --> 00:10:07.240
It's confusing at first, isn't it?

00:10:07.240 --> 00:10:09.170
But there's no need to be scared.

00:10:09.170 --> 00:10:12.850
I think that feeling is the 
happiness that comes from talking

00:10:12.850 --> 00:10:15.250
and laughing with others.

00:10:21.460 --> 00:10:24.420
It means you're not alone anymore, An-chan.

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:30.470
I was right! It looks great!

00:10:31.330 --> 00:10:32.360
An-chan...

00:10:32.740 --> 00:10:34.400
We're the same now!

00:10:36.170 --> 00:10:37.480
<i>The same...</i>

00:10:37.480 --> 00:10:38.580
<i>No, we're not.</i>

00:10:39.210 --> 00:10:41.250
<i>We're not the same.</i>

00:10:42.190 --> 00:10:44.410
<i>Hitomi only thinks of me as her friend</i>

00:10:44.810 --> 00:10:46.910
<i>because she thinks I'm human.</i>

00:10:48.730 --> 00:10:49.830
An-chan?

00:10:52.150 --> 00:10:53.440
What's wrong?

00:10:53.440 --> 00:10:55.000
Sorry, Hitomi.

00:11:11.710 --> 00:11:13.900
Take me along, too.

00:11:15.150 --> 00:11:16.650
Don't interfere!

00:11:16.650 --> 00:11:19.490
That wild sensation I felt in your hand...

00:11:19.490 --> 00:11:21.490
You're not really human, are you?!

00:11:25.590 --> 00:11:27.460
<i>Seton Academy: Join the Pack!</i>

00:11:27.460 --> 00:11:30.000
<i>White tiger!</i>

00:11:30.860 --> 00:11:32.780
<i>Seton Academy: Join the Pack!</i>

00:11:32.780 --> 00:11:35.000
<i>Hippopotamus!</i>

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:40.010
<b>Seton Café</b>

00:11:35.620 --> 00:11:37.550
Hino-san and Anetani-san 
sure are taking a while.

00:11:37.550 --> 00:11:40.010
Yena-san hasn't come back, either.

00:11:40.010 --> 00:11:42.210
Maybe I should go check out the gardening club.

00:11:42.210 --> 00:11:44.430
And I'll go check the cafeteria!

00:11:45.780 --> 00:11:46.980
<i>Damn it...</i>

00:11:46.980 --> 00:11:49.430
<i>I don't know which ones are humans 
because I've never seen one.</i>

00:11:49.430 --> 00:11:52.270
This honey waffle is yummy!

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:54.390
Hey, tiny. Are you human?

00:11:54.390 --> 00:11:54.980
Huh?

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:56.820
If you try to hide the truth, 
I'll bite you in half!

00:11:56.820 --> 00:11:58.710
I'll show no mercy, even to a female!

00:11:58.710 --> 00:12:02.030
Boss, look at this! 
He's paying attention to me!

00:12:02.730 --> 00:12:05.530
What do you think you're doing to my underling?

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:07.330
Wha... Oh, um...

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:09.930
I-I was asking if she knew of a place 
that had good honey waffles...

00:12:09.930 --> 00:12:12.790
He said he'd bite me in half and 
show no mercy, even to a female!

00:12:17.290 --> 00:12:18.890
Is that...

00:12:18.890 --> 00:12:20.770
What are you cooking in that?

00:12:20.770 --> 00:12:22.220
A special menu item!

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:25.860
I made it from a special 
ingredient the rabbits gave me!

00:12:25.860 --> 00:12:28.220
I thought I'd serve it as a 
special menu item tomorrow!

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:29.130
Huh?

00:12:29.130 --> 00:12:30.850
Rabbits... Don't tell me that's...

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:35.350
Yes! This aroma!

00:12:35.350 --> 00:12:37.230
I knew it.

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:39.360
Excuse me.

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:41.990
<b>Cherish Our Rivers</b>

00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:41.990
Did you make that?

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:43.540
Who are you?

00:12:43.540 --> 00:12:45.450
We're closed for today.

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:48.050
That looks quite delicious.

00:12:48.050 --> 00:12:48.490
Huh?!

00:12:48.490 --> 00:12:49.910
I'm glad you think so!

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:52.200
Would you like to taste it?

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:53.120
<b>Cherish Our Rivers</b>

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:53.120
By all means.

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:58.170
Please, help yourself.

00:12:58.170 --> 00:13:00.050
Why'd you give it to us, too?

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:05.070
<i>The plan is to approach them 
amicably and catch them off-guard.</i>

00:13:05.070 --> 00:13:05.800
<i>But...</i>

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:07.800
<i>This food...</i>

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:11.240
<i>No, I mean, it's true that pandas 
eat this when they're babies, too.</i>

00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:13.330
<i>But this is on another level!</i>

00:13:13.330 --> 00:13:15.560
<i>And she wants to serve this to customers?</i>

00:13:16.330 --> 00:13:17.570
Zhen de ma?!

00:13:17.570 --> 00:13:20.240
Hao... Hao... Hao chi!

00:13:20.240 --> 00:13:22.770
<i>Since smells can carry through water,</i>

00:13:22.770 --> 00:13:25.780
<i>there are many marine creatures 
with an excellent sense of smell.</i>

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:27.860
<i>But species of the suborder Odontoceti</i>

00:13:27.860 --> 00:13:31.070
<i>that have developed echolocation, 
including dolphins,</i>

00:13:31.070 --> 00:13:35.790
<i>have lost their sense of smell entirely 
because they no longer need it.</i>

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:38.960
<i>I've never tasted anything so delicious!</i>

00:13:39.300 --> 00:13:41.090
Sniff, sniff, sniff...

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:42.850
That's weird.

00:13:42.850 --> 00:13:45.920
Why would Yena be out here 
and not in the cafeteria?

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:48.730
What? I smell Hitomi and An this way, too.

00:13:49.980 --> 00:13:52.260
Now <i>that</i> is all I can smell!

00:13:52.780 --> 00:13:55.520
Where'd Hitomi-chan go off to?

00:13:55.910 --> 00:13:58.270
She hadn't been by the gardening club...

00:13:59.010 --> 00:14:01.510
Did something happen to her and Anetani-san?

00:14:01.510 --> 00:14:03.110
Wait! Don't tell me...

00:14:03.540 --> 00:14:06.110
Did she find out Anetani-san likes me?!

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:09.070
So you've been after Jin-kun from the start?!

00:14:09.070 --> 00:14:10.860
Silly Hitomi.

00:14:10.860 --> 00:14:14.370
Jin-kun is already my little prisoner.

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:17.220
Grr! You won't get away with this!

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:19.170
What are you doing?!

00:14:20.660 --> 00:14:21.920
That's bad!

00:14:22.430 --> 00:14:23.710
Really bad!

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:26.790
That would be really, really bad!

00:14:26.790 --> 00:14:29.180
Ow! Oh, sorr—

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:33.330
I found you, human male.

00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:36.640
Didn't you ever learn that it's 
dangerous to be away from your pride?

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:38.930
Wh-Who the hell are you?!

00:14:38.930 --> 00:14:41.390
I am a Barbary lion!

00:14:41.390 --> 00:14:45.130
I'm here to avenge my species, which went
 extinct at the hands of humans!

00:14:45.130 --> 00:14:46.870
A B-Barbary lion?!

00:14:46.870 --> 00:14:47.820
That's right.

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:50.830
If you humans hadn't driven us to extinction,

00:14:50.830 --> 00:14:53.330
everything on Earth would 
have belonged to us!

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:54.700
Hang on! You guys—

00:14:54.700 --> 00:14:56.540
Just capturing you isn't enough!

00:14:56.540 --> 00:14:58.160
Die!

00:14:59.900 --> 00:15:00.660
What?

00:15:03.060 --> 00:15:04.590
The stupid lion!

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:07.090
What do you think you're doing?

00:15:07.700 --> 00:15:08.430
Ow.

00:15:08.430 --> 00:15:10.150
I could ask you the same thing.

00:15:10.910 --> 00:15:13.730
Jin-dono here is our savior.

00:15:13.730 --> 00:15:15.350
I will not allow such insolence!

00:15:16.750 --> 00:15:17.660
You guys!

00:15:18.230 --> 00:15:22.650
A human... is your savior?

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:25.650
You are a disgrace to all lions!

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:28.150
A traitor like you is better off...

00:15:28.880 --> 00:15:31.470
going extinct along with the humans!

00:15:34.770 --> 00:15:35.460
Stupid lion!

00:15:35.460 --> 00:15:36.080
Kin-kun!

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:37.630
Are you okay?

00:15:37.630 --> 00:15:39.810
Stay back, Shiho-dono!

00:15:39.810 --> 00:15:41.960
Please, tell me you're joking.

00:15:42.310 --> 00:15:45.460
You're not really mated 
with an impala, are you?!

00:15:48.050 --> 00:15:51.150
I've never seen such a 
pathetic excuse for a lion!

00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:53.630
But it does explain why you don't have a mane!

00:15:53.630 --> 00:15:56.380
Bahahaha-rbarybarybary!

00:15:55.060 --> 00:15:57.100
Kin-kun is not pathetic!

00:15:57.100 --> 00:15:57.680
Huh?

00:15:58.110 --> 00:16:02.190
Kin-kun is kind... and sincere... and amazing!

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:04.560
He's way stronger than a jerk like you!

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:06.110
Shiho-dono, watch out!

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:07.550
Smack.

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:14.390
You have some nerve speaking 
to me, herbivore.

00:16:16.380 --> 00:16:17.990
Wh-What now?

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:25.380
What?!

00:16:29.710 --> 00:16:31.050
<i>What power!</i>

00:16:31.050 --> 00:16:33.590
<i>It's like he's not the same 
lion he was a moment ago!</i>

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:42.230
You have that much strength, and you 
resigned yourself to being a mere baldy?

00:16:42.230 --> 00:16:43.100
Why?

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:44.850
All for...

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:46.350
love!

00:16:45.120 --> 00:16:46.350
<b>Love</b>

00:16:46.350 --> 00:16:49.860
Love? That's just modern nonsense.

00:16:50.130 --> 00:16:54.650
I'll teach you just how meaningless it 
is to a species that's gone extinct!

00:16:54.650 --> 00:17:00.300
Feel the power of an extinct 
animal's resentment and hatred!

00:17:00.300 --> 00:17:00.910
No, no.

00:17:00.910 --> 00:17:02.660
You guys didn't go extinct.

00:17:04.660 --> 00:17:05.460
Huh?

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:07.170
I said you didn't go extinct.

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:12.290
<i>It was believed that Barbary 
lions went extinct in 1922,</i>

00:17:12.290 --> 00:17:14.100
<i>but they were rediscovered 
in recent years</i>

00:17:14.100 --> 00:17:17.180
<i>and are slowly growing in number again.</i>

00:17:19.550 --> 00:17:21.810
We didn't go extinct!

00:17:21.810 --> 00:17:24.190
Gotcha!

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:25.980
What?

00:17:26.320 --> 00:17:28.390
Anetani-san took Hitomi-chan?

00:17:28.390 --> 00:17:30.610
Yes, just like I said.

00:17:30.610 --> 00:17:33.320
But... why would she...

00:17:34.330 --> 00:17:36.850
My associates who infiltrated 
this campus with me

00:17:36.850 --> 00:17:38.720
have probably joined Anetani-kun by now

00:17:38.720 --> 00:17:41.200
to carry out our mission.

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:45.760
Ah... Life is permeating 
this extinct body of mine.

00:17:45.760 --> 00:17:49.460
It almost feels as if what 
I lost is returning to me.

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:50.870
Extinct?

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:51.650
Ex...tinct?

00:17:51.650 --> 00:17:55.300
The joy of eating... 
also known as the joy of living!

00:17:57.270 --> 00:18:01.020
You helped me remember something truly precious.

00:18:01.020 --> 00:18:05.770
I'm happy, too. No one has ever 
enjoyed my cooking so much before!

00:18:06.130 --> 00:18:09.020
Please tell me what this dish is!

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:11.770
Sure! It's a gift from the rabbits!

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:15.360
If it's for Yukari-chan, 
nothing's too much to ask!

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:20.270
Since we met you, someone who accepts 
our embarrassing biology for what it is,

00:18:20.270 --> 00:18:23.740
we can finally feel proud 
of the way we live!

00:18:23.740 --> 00:18:27.570
<i>Rabbits excrete plant nutrients 
that they can't digest</i>

00:18:27.570 --> 00:18:30.150
<i>after fermenting them inside their cecum,</i>

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:31.690
<i>and they then eat the excrement.</i>

00:18:31.690 --> 00:18:32.750
<i>In other words...</i>

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:38.500
Yes, they all did their best to produce 
it for our restaurant's sake.

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:41.340
It's the finest poop around!

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:44.720
What on earth is the matter?!

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:46.680
<b>All-You-Can-Eat</b>

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:46.680
<b>Restaurant</b>

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:46.680
<b>See You Tomorrow</b>

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:46.680
You really have to ask?!

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:52.120
The modern species' culture 
festival is a terrifying thing...

00:18:52.120 --> 00:18:53.400
Excuse me, sir.

00:18:53.730 --> 00:18:56.030
Would you like to try the ring toss?

00:18:53.730 --> 00:18:56.030
<b>Ring Toss</b>

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:58.570
No, I really need to carry out my mission...

00:18:58.570 --> 00:19:00.700
Don't say that! Come on, step right up!

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:02.370
A-All right, just for a bit...

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:03.660
Hino-san!

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:05.300
Hitomi-dono!

00:19:05.300 --> 00:19:08.120
Hitomi-san! Where are you?

00:19:09.410 --> 00:19:10.500
<i>Hitomi-chan!</i>

00:19:22.220 --> 00:19:23.430
Hold up.

00:19:24.750 --> 00:19:28.060
This isn't over yet.

00:19:28.060 --> 00:19:30.220
It will end the same way every time.

00:19:30.690 --> 00:19:33.310
I have no reason to injure you any further.

00:19:33.310 --> 00:19:35.690
So you don't care if Hitomi gets hurt?!

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:39.240
What are you gonna say to Hitomi

00:19:39.240 --> 00:19:41.780
after pretending you were 
human to deceive her?

00:19:41.780 --> 00:19:45.240
Were you just pretending to be her friend, too?

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:52.950
What's so bad about deception?!

00:19:52.950 --> 00:19:55.330
Could a spotted hyena understand how I feel

00:19:55.330 --> 00:19:57.420
after being driven to extinction by humans?!

00:19:57.420 --> 00:19:59.390
Humans are our enemy!

00:19:59.390 --> 00:20:01.840
I could never be friends with one!

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:16.070
Impossible...

00:20:17.780 --> 00:20:19.730
I finally found you!

00:20:19.730 --> 00:20:23.430
What're you two doing? 
Didn't you shake hands earlier?

00:20:23.430 --> 00:20:25.190
Listen to me, Ranka.

00:20:25.190 --> 00:20:28.950
Her goal from the start was to take Hitomi away!

00:20:28.950 --> 00:20:29.890
What?!

00:20:29.890 --> 00:20:34.100
She approached all of you in the 
guise of a human to get revenge

00:20:34.100 --> 00:20:36.500
against the humans who pushed 
her kind to extinction!

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:37.430
You're lying!

00:20:37.430 --> 00:20:38.760
It's no lie.

00:20:38.760 --> 00:20:40.740
An would never do that!

00:20:40.740 --> 00:20:42.190
She's our packmate!

00:20:42.190 --> 00:20:43.900
Isn't that right, An?

00:20:44.700 --> 00:20:45.830
It's true.

00:20:46.470 --> 00:20:50.890
I came to this school to get 
revenge on Hitomi and Mazama Jin!

00:20:50.890 --> 00:20:51.670
No!

00:20:51.670 --> 00:20:53.510
That can't be true! 'Cause...

00:20:54.730 --> 00:20:55.670
What are you doing?!

00:20:56.070 --> 00:20:59.290
Stop! I know you don't really want to do this!

00:20:59.290 --> 00:21:00.720
Give it up, Ranka!

00:21:00.720 --> 00:21:02.360
No! Because...

00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:06.110
An has such a sad smell!

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:12.070
<i>Dogs can smell the chemicals in human 
sweat and other bodily substances,</i>

00:21:12.070 --> 00:21:15.160
<i>which allows them to recognize 
complex human emotions.</i>

00:21:15.160 --> 00:21:17.200
That has nothing to do with this!

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:18.700
You're wrong!

00:21:19.130 --> 00:21:20.250
A boss...

00:21:20.250 --> 00:21:23.090
has to have faith in 
her packmates, no matter what!

00:21:25.150 --> 00:21:26.090
So...

00:21:26.410 --> 00:21:29.100
Don't do this anymore. Let's be friends.

00:21:31.770 --> 00:21:33.600
Enough!

00:21:33.600 --> 00:21:36.950
You impertinent modern animals!

00:21:36.950 --> 00:21:37.820
Who's there?

00:21:37.820 --> 00:21:39.770
I hear a voice inside my head...

00:21:40.730 --> 00:21:42.470
Wh-What's happening?

00:21:42.470 --> 00:21:43.650
An earthquake?

00:21:44.290 --> 00:21:45.530
Boss...

00:21:46.900 --> 00:21:48.280
You will not

00:21:48.280 --> 00:21:51.460
stand in our way any longer!

00:22:19.040 --> 00:22:20.540
<b>Awoooo</b>

00:22:20.920 --> 00:22:22.540
<b>Awoooo</b>

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:25.520
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:25.380 --> 00:23:26.090
Jin here!

00:23:25.520 --> 00:23:35.280
<b>(If I can save Hitomi-chan now,)</b>

00:23:26.090 --> 00:23:29.420
No matter what the reason, I won't 
allow anyone to threaten our school lives!

00:23:27.230 --> 00:23:35.280
<b>(she's sure to fall in love with me.)</b>

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:35.660
<b>Ranka here!</b>

00:23:30.150 --> 00:23:36.200
<b>As this pack's boss, I'll protect both Jin and Hitomi!</b>

00:23:31.260 --> 00:23:33.220
No, there's no need 
for you to get hurt!

00:23:31.260 --> 00:23:36.530
<b>(You dumb dog! If you do that,)</b>

00:23:32.320 --> 00:23:36.530
<b>(I won't get to look cool at all!)</b>

00:23:33.220 --> 00:23:34.180
I'll handle this!

00:23:33.490 --> 00:23:37.370
<b>No! Any boss that doesn't fight now</b>

00:23:34.070 --> 00:23:37.370
<b>isn't a real boss!</b>

00:23:34.600 --> 00:23:35.760
No, me!

00:23:34.820 --> 00:23:37.910
<b>No, me!</b>

00:23:35.280 --> 00:23:38.540
<b>No, me, the boss!</b>

00:23:35.660 --> 00:23:38.870
<b>Me!</b>

00:23:35.760 --> 00:23:36.350
Me!

00:23:35.910 --> 00:23:38.870
<b>Me!</b>

00:23:36.350 --> 00:23:39.370
Me! Me! Me! Me!

00:23:39.370 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Seton Academy Record 12</b>

00:23:39.370 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>The Animal Students I Know</b>
